+/* Version history
+    1.17    - 2019-07-08 - fix CVE-2019-13217, -13218, -13219, -13220, -13221, -13222, -13223
+                           found with Mayhem by ForAllSecure
+    1.16    - 2019-03-04 - fix warnings
